---
// English-only Black Friday sign-up page. Sign-ups go to the newsletter table (D1) with source='blackfriday'.
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'; import NewsL from '../components/NewsL.astro';
const title='Black Friday padel deals: which discounts are real?';
---
<Base lang="en-GB" noindex title={title+' | WhichPadel'} description="We're tracking prices on popular padel rackets across UK shops. Get one email before Black Friday (27 Nov 2026) showing which discounts are genuine and which are inflated.">
<article class="panel prose">
<h1>{title}</h1>
<p>Black Friday is on 27 November 2026. Some "deals" are real price drops; others compare against a price the racket rarely sold at.</p>
<p>We're tracking prices on popular padel rackets across UK shops. Before Black Friday we'll send one email flagging which discounts look genuine and which look inflated, based on the prices we've recorded.</p>
<p>No spam: one Black Friday email, and you can unsubscribe at any time.</p>
<NewsL lang="en" src="blackfriday"/>
</article>
</Base>
